BT /F1 22 Tf 50 760 Td (FitBuddy) Tj ET
BT /F1 16 Tf 50 731 Td (Problem-Solution Map) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 706 Td (How the proposed app features address the needs in the project brief) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 50 668 Td (1. No clear starting routine) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 645 Td (Problem: People with a fitness goal may not know what to do each day.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 629 Td (Solution: Generate a structured 7-day workout plan tailored to the stated goal,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 613 Td (age, weight, and preferred intensity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 50 577 Td (2. Generic plans may not fit the user) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 554 Td (Problem: One-size-fits-all routines can feel too difficult, too easy, or irrelevant.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 538 Td (Solution: Collect basic user preferences and use them as context for plan generation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 50 502 Td (3. Plans are difficult to adjust) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 479 Td (Problem: User needs and preferences can change after they try the routine.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 463 Td (Solution: Let users submit feedback and generate a revised plan while retaining) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 447 Td (the original version for comparison.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 50 411 Td (4. Exercise advice lacks supporting guidance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 388 Td (Problem: A workout routine may not remind users about recovery or related habits.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 372 Td (Solution: Show a short goal-related nutrition or recovery tip with the workout plan.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 50 336 Td (5. Coaches need visibility across plans) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 313 Td (Problem: A coach managing multiple users may need a consolidated way to review plans.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 297 Td (Solution: Provide a coach/admin page listing user details and original/updated plans,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 281 Td (with access limited to authorized staff.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 50 245 Td (6. Complex interfaces can discourage use) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 222 Td (Problem: Long forms and cluttered results make it harder to start and follow a plan.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 206 Td (Solution: Use a short input form, readable day-by-day results, and a clear feedback action.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 50 170 Td (Expected outcome) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 147 Td (A user can enter basic details, receive a clear first plan, try it, and request a change.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 131 Td (The product supports general fitness planning; it should communicate limits clearly,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 115 Td (respect user ability, and not present AI output as medical advice.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 50 50 Td (Problem-solution ideas are based on the supplied FitBuddy project brief.) Tj ET

